{
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_302_soldier_man_ev_talk.txt/8": "\\c[51]男性剑士佣兵\\c[0]\r\n开始跟随你了！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_303_soldier_man_after_ev_damage.txt/0": "不妙……！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_303_soldier_man_after_ev_damage.txt/1": "唔……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_303_soldier_man_after_ev_damage.txt/2": "好痛！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_303_soldier_man_after_ev_darkness.txt/0": "怎、怎么会……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_303_soldier_man_after_ev_find.txt/0": "等等！",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_303_soldier_man_after_ev_talk.txt/234": "\\c[4]给予疗伤草_\\c[52]剩余$tmp2_remaining\\c[2][浪费]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_303_soldier_man_after_ev_talk.txt/345": "\\c[4]给予疗伤膏_\\c[52]剩余$tmp2_remaining\\c[2][浪费]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_303_soldier_man_after_ev_talk.txt/503": "给予疗伤草_\\c[52]剩余$tmp2_remaining\\c[2]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_303_soldier_man_after_ev_talk.txt/611": "\\c[4]给予疗伤草_\\c[52]剩余$tmp2_remaining\\c[2]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_303_soldier_man_after_ev_talk.txt/751": "给予疗伤膏_\\c[52]剩余$tmp2_remaining\\c[2]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_303_soldier_man_after_ev_talk.txt/860": "\\c[4]给予疗伤膏_\\c[52]剩余$tmp2_remaining\\c[2]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_303_soldier_man_after_ev_talk.txt/959": "你还好吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_303_soldier_man_after_ev_talk.txt/0": "看来几乎没受伤，\r\n不需要治疗。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_303_soldier_man_after_ev_talk.txt/1": "你没有任何治疗物品！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_303_soldier_man_after_ev_talk.txt/2": "我没受伤。\r\n倒是你，多顾顾自己吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_303_soldier_man_after_ev_talk.txt/3": "受了点伤，\r\n不过还能继续打。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_303_soldier_man_after_ev_talk.txt/4": "情况有点不妙，\r\n我觉得还能再挨一下，\r\n但也仅此而已……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_303_soldier_man_after_ev_talk.txt/5": "再这样下去……我可能会死……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_303_soldier_man_after_ev_talk.txt/6": "嘎吱嘎吱……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_303_soldier_man_after_ev_talk.txt/7": "HP恢复了50%。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_303_soldier_man_after_ev_talk.txt/8": "谢啦！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_303_soldier_man_after_ev_talk.txt/9": "咕咚咕咚……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_303_soldier_man_after_ev_talk.txt/10": "HP已完全恢复。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_303_soldier_man_after_ev_talk.txt/11": "好耶！\r\nHP完全恢复了！\r\n又能继续战斗了！",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_304_soldier_woman_ev_talk.txt/245": "雇佣_\\c[52]$tmp3拉比斯\\c[0]（CHR_\\c[52]$tmp1\\c[0]→\\c[2]$tmp2_Insuff.\\c[0]）",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_304_soldier_woman_ev_talk.txt/356": "雇佣_\\c[52]$tmp3拉比斯\\c[0]（CHR_\\c[52]$tmp1\\c[0]→\\c[3]$tmp2\\c[0]）",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_304_soldier_woman_ev_talk.txt/447": "雇佣_\\c[52]$tmp3拉比斯\\c[0]（CHR_\\c[52]$tmp1\\c[0]→\\c[3]$tmp2\\c[0]）",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_304_soldier_woman_ev_talk.txt/536": "不用了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_304_soldier_woman_ev_talk.txt/0": "嗨，我是漂泊的佣兵。\r\n看来你正在旅行，\r\n怎么样，要不要雇佣我？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_304_soldier_woman_ev_talk.txt/1": "价钱嘛……就定为$tmp3拉比斯吧……\r\n你觉得如何？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_304_soldier_woman_ev_talk.txt/2": "若你愿意雇佣我，\r\n我以骑士之名起誓，\r\n直到冒险结束都会做你的盾。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_304_soldier_woman_ev_talk.txt/3": "有护卫跟着会安心不少。\r\n不过似乎无法越过山地和水边。\r\n要雇佣护卫吗？\r\n\\c[52][协力NPC，需要CHR等级1]",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_304_soldier_woman_ev_talk.txt/4": "抱歉，你的钱似乎不够。\r\n我也不是在做慈善。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_304_soldier_woman_ev_talk.txt/5": "这样啊，祝你旅途顺利。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_304_soldier_woman_ev_talk.txt/6": "虽然是我先开口提议，实在抱歉，\r\n但你的眼神……让人感觉\r\n不太值得信任。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_304_soldier_woman_ev_talk.txt/7": "魅力似乎不够……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_304_soldier_woman_ev_talk.txt/8": "很好！今后请多关照。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_304_soldier_woman_ev_talk.txt/9": "\\c[51]女性骑士佣兵\\c[0]\r\n开始跟随你了！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_305_soldier_woman_after_ev_damage.txt/0": "什么？！不妙……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_305_soldier_woman_after_ev_damage.txt/1": "唔……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_305_soldier_woman_after_ev_damage.txt/2": "咳！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_305_soldier_woman_after_ev_darkness.txt/0": "怎么会……\r\n竟在这种地方……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_305_soldier_woman_after_ev_find.txt/0": "咳……抱歉。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_305_soldier_woman_after_ev_talk.txt/227": "\\c[4]给予疗伤草_\\c[52]剩余$tmp2_remaining\\c[2][浪费]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_305_soldier_woman_after_ev_talk.txt/338": "\\c[4]给予疗伤膏_\\c[52]剩余$tmp2_remaining\\c[2][浪费]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_305_soldier_woman_after_ev_talk.txt/496": "给予疗伤草_\\c[52]剩余$tmp2_remaining\\c[2]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_305_soldier_woman_after_ev_talk.txt/604": "\\c[4]给予疗伤草_\\c[52]剩余$tmp2_remaining\\c[2]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_305_soldier_woman_after_ev_talk.txt/744": "给予疗伤膏_\\c[52]剩余$tmp2_remaining\\c[2]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_305_soldier_woman_after_ev_talk.txt/853": "\\c[4]给予疗伤膏_\\c[52]剩余$tmp2_remaining\\c[2]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_305_soldier_woman_after_ev_talk.txt/952": "你还好吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_305_soldier_woman_after_ev_talk.txt/0": "看来几乎没受伤，\r\n不需要治疗。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_305_soldier_woman_after_ev_talk.txt/1": "你没有任何治疗物品！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_305_soldier_woman_after_ev_talk.txt/2": "现在还没受伤……不过，\r\n谢谢你的关心。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_305_soldier_woman_after_ev_talk.txt/3": "有点痛，不过目前\r\n还能撑得住。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_305_soldier_woman_after_ev_talk.txt/4": "唔……\r\n这样下去可不妙。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_305_soldier_woman_after_ev_talk.txt/5": "抱歉……我可能无法\r\n护送你到最后了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_305_soldier_woman_after_ev_talk.txt/6": "嘎吱嘎吱……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_305_soldier_woman_after_ev_talk.txt/7": "HP恢复了50%。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_305_soldier_woman_after_ev_talk.txt/8": "谢谢，我欠你一个人情。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_305_soldier_woman_after_ev_talk.txt/9": "咕咚咕咚……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_305_soldier_woman_after_ev_talk.txt/10": "HP已完全恢复。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_305_soldier_woman_after_ev_talk.txt/11": "本该由我保护你，\r\n结果反而被你救了。\r\n……谢谢。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_306_magic_user_ev_talk.txt/247": "雇佣_\\c[52]$tmp3拉比斯\\c[0]（CHR_\\c[52]$tmp1\\c[0]→\\c[2]$tmp2_Insuff.\\c[0]）",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_306_magic_user_ev_talk.txt/358": "雇佣_\\c[52]$tmp3拉比斯\\c[0]（CHR_\\c[52]$tmp1\\c[0]→\\c[3]$tmp2\\c[0]）",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_306_magic_user_ev_talk.txt/449": "雇佣_\\c[52]$tmp3拉比斯\\c[0]（CHR_\\c[52]$tmp1\\c[0]→\\c[3]$tmp2\\c[0]）",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_306_magic_user_ev_talk.txt/538": "不用了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_306_magic_user_ev_talk.txt/0": "我是……术士……\r\n给我$tmp3拉比斯的话……\r\n……我就跟你走。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_306_magic_user_ev_talk.txt/1": "有护卫跟着会安心不少。\r\n不过似乎无法越过山地和水边。\r\n要雇佣护卫吗？\r\n\\c[52][协力NPC，需要CHR等级1]",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_306_magic_user_ev_talk.txt/2": "钱……不够……吧？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_306_magic_user_ev_talk.txt/3": "果然……是这样……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_306_magic_user_ev_talk.txt/4": "……果然还是不要！\r\n你身上有种可怕的感觉。\r\n对不起。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_306_magic_user_ev_talk.txt/5": "魅力似乎不够……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_306_magic_user_ev_talk.txt/6": "真的吗？\r\n……我会努力试试的。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_306_magic_user_ev_talk.txt/7": "\\c[51]女性术士佣兵\\c[0]\r\n开始跟随你了！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_307_magic_user_after_ev_damage.txt/0": "呀！！救命……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_307_magic_user_after_ev_damage.txt/1": "唔！……可能不妙……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_307_magic_user_after_ev_damage.txt/2": "呜……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_307_magic_user_after_ev_darkness.txt/0": "诶…………\r\n怎么会……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_307_magic_user_after_ev_find.txt/0": "对不起……",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_307_magic_user_after_ev_talk.txt/228": "\\c[4]给予疗伤草_\\c[52]剩余$tmp2_remaining\\c[2][浪费]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_307_magic_user_after_ev_talk.txt/339": "\\c[4]给予疗伤膏_\\c[52]剩余$tmp2_remaining\\c[2][浪费]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_307_magic_user_after_ev_talk.txt/497": "给予疗伤草_\\c[52]剩余$tmp2_remaining\\c[2]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_307_magic_user_after_ev_talk.txt/605": "\\c[4]给予疗伤草_\\c[52]剩余$tmp2_remaining\\c[2]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_307_magic_user_after_ev_talk.txt/745": "给予疗伤膏_\\c[52]剩余$tmp2_remaining\\c[2]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_307_magic_user_after_ev_talk.txt/854": "\\c[4]给予疗伤膏_\\c[52]剩余$tmp2_remaining\\c[2]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_307_magic_user_after_ev_talk.txt/953": "你还好吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_307_magic_user_after_ev_talk.txt/0": "看来几乎没受伤，\r\n不需要治疗。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_307_magic_user_after_ev_talk.txt/1": "你没有任何治疗物品！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_307_magic_user_after_ev_talk.txt/2": "我、我还没受伤……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_307_magic_user_after_ev_talk.txt/3": "只是有点痛……\r\n还……还没事……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_307_magic_user_after_ev_talk.txt/4": "好痛……\r\n怎么办……好害怕。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_307_magic_user_after_ev_talk.txt/5": "糟了……我会死吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_307_magic_user_after_ev_talk.txt/6": "嘎吱嘎吱……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_307_magic_user_after_ev_talk.txt/7": "HP恢复了50%。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_307_magic_user_after_ev_talk.txt/8": "……谢谢。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_307_magic_user_after_ev_talk.txt/9": "咕咚咕咚……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_307_magic_user_after_ev_talk.txt/10": "HP已完全恢复。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_307_magic_user_after_ev_talk.txt/11": "……谢谢。\r\n我会……更加努力的。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/0": "嗯……您终于要启程了。\r\n\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]大人……",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/133": "请教我查看装备性能的基础方法！",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/195": "请教我关于武器的事！",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/241": "请教我关于追加装备的事！",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/291": "力量或敏捷提升后有什么意义？",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/344": "请教我移动技巧！",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/398": "什么是快捷键？",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/439": "请教我关于食物的事！",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/482": "梦幻石是什么？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/1": "启程之前……\r\n您还有什么想问的吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/2": "要查看装备性能，请打开菜单，\r\n把光标移到想确认的装备上，\r\n查看详细信息即可。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/3": "首先是“\\c[52]WT\\c[0]”。可携带的WT有限。\r\n沉重的装备往往性能也相应出色，\r\n但会大量占用负重。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/4": "另外，武器和防具都有\\c[52]耐久度\\c[0]，\r\n会随着使用而消耗。\r\n耐久度降到\\c[53]0\\c[0]时就会损坏。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/5": "装备分为“\\c[52]武器\\c[0]”“\\c[52]防具\\c[0]”\r\n和“\\c[52]追加装备\\c[0]”，\r\n不同种类显示的信息也不同。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/6": "首先说明\\c[52]武器\\c[0]。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/7": "\\i[8000]代表\\c[52]近战攻击\\c[0]，\r\n\\i[8001]代表\\c[52]远程攻击\\c[0]，\r\n\\i[8002]代表\\c[52]魔法攻击\\c[0]。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/8": "装备时，根据\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]的\r\n\\c[52]力量\\c[0]、\\c[52]意志\\c[0]以及所受状态，\r\n增加的\\c[52]攻击力\\c[0]和\\c[52]魔力\\c[0]会发生变化。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/9": "此外，\\c[52]某些特殊武器\\c[0]和\r\n\\c[52]枪械\\c[0]即使数值显示为\\c[53]0\\c[0]，\r\n也会发挥与普通攻击不同的效果。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/10": "这类武器可以阅读说明，\r\n若WT有余裕，也不妨实际用一次。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/11": "接下来是\\c[52]防具\\c[0]。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/12": "\\i[8003]代表\\c[52]护甲\\c[0]，\r\n\\i[8004]代表\\c[52]减伤\\c[0]。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/13": "基本上数值越高，防具越优秀，\r\n\\c[52]受到的伤害也会减少\\c[0]。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/14": "接下来说明\\c[52]盾牌等部分追加装备\\c[0]。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/15": "\\i[8005]代表\\c[52]发动率\\c[0]，\r\n\\i[8006]代表\\c[52]护甲\\c[0]，\r\n\\i[8007]代表\\c[52]减伤\\c[0]。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/16": "盾牌等装备具有\\c[52]发动率\\c[0]。\r\n只有发动时，\\c[52]护甲\\c[0]和\\c[52]减伤\\c[0]才会生效。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/17": "这类装备并非必定发动，\r\n所以不像普通防具那样\r\n直接把\\c[52]护甲\\c[0]计入属性。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/18": "话虽长了，但要根据这些信息判断：\r\n装备哪些、随身携带哪些、丢弃哪些、卖掉哪些、\r\n买下哪些，以及把哪些放入梦幻仓库。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/19": "请结合职业和当前处境，\r\n找出最适合自己的装备。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/20": "接下来说武器。\r\n这个世界的武器种类繁多，\r\n我来介绍各类武器的特长。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/21": "首先是“\\c[52]剑\\c[0]”，种类最为丰富。\r\nWT范围广，耐久度尚可，\r\n连击率也很优秀。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/22": "其次是“\\c[52]枪\\c[0]”，略显沉重，\r\n连击率不算高，\r\n但最大的魅力是能攻击两格外的敌人。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/23": "“\\c[52]斧\\c[0]”非常沉重，连击率很低，\r\n但单次攻击威力和破墙性能\r\n都属于顶级武器。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/24": "“\\c[52]杖\\c[0]”通常很轻、耐久高，\r\n会提升魔力，部分杖还会赋予集中。\r\n对施法者来说必不可少。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/25": "“\\c[52]拳斗武器\\c[0]”连击率高，\r\n而且在击倒敌人后，\r\n剩余连击会继续攻击周围的其他敌人。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/26": "远程武器“\\c[52]弓\\c[0]”\r\n是提升箭矢射程与威力的专用武器。\r\n不搭配箭矢装备就毫无意义。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/27": "接着是远程武器“\\c[52]枪械\\c[0]”，\r\n能消耗魔力，\r\n沿直线释放贯通攻击。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/28": "最后是远程武器“\\c[52]回旋镖\\c[0]”，\r\n威力虽低，却能画出特殊轨迹、越过墙壁，\r\n攻击不在直线上的敌人。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/29": "似乎还有一些特殊武器，\r\n不过主要种类大致就是这些。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/30": "武器用于攻击，防具用于防护，\r\n而\\c[52]追加装备\\c[0]的用途\r\n则多种多样。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/31": "能提升防御性能的“\\c[52]盾牌\\c[0]”等类型，\r\n基本和武器、防具一样拥有耐久度。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/32": "想减少受到的伤害时，可以装备它们。\r\n似乎也有职业能让盾牌效果翻倍。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/33": "其中许多WT很高，\r\n若职业本身负重能力不足，\r\n可能很难使用。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/34": "装备“\\c[52]箭矢\\c[0]”后按\\my[-5]\\sysS[70]\\my[-5]，\r\n若近战攻击够不到，且正前方没有可交谈对象，\r\n就会射出箭矢。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/35": "远程攻击对只能近战的敌人非常有效，\r\n但请记住，\r\n基础射程只有2格。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/36": "以箭矢为主要手段时，\r\n建议搭配弓装备，\r\n因为能提高射程与威力。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/37": "不过必须确认直线路径上没有NPC。\r\n万一误伤到人……\r\n后果会非常严重，务必小心。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/38": "此外，“\\c[52]八音盒\\c[0]”能提升同伴士气，\r\n“\\c[52]靴子\\c[0]”则对移动等方面产生影响。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/39": "还有，装备受诅咒的追加装备后，\r\nST会持续减少。ST降到0后，\r\n就会开始减少HP。务必注意。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/40": "随身携带怎样的“\\c[52]追加装备\\c[0]”……\r\n这也是左右旅途成败的\r\n重要因素。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/41": "那么，就来讲解主要属性：\r\n“\\c[52]力量\\c[0]”“\\c[52]敏捷\\c[0]”“\\c[52]生命\\c[0]”“\\c[52]智力\\c[0]”\r\n“\\c[52]意志\\c[0]”“\\c[52]魅力\\c[0]”。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_309_plus_old_man_ev_talk.txt/42": "首先，\\c[52]力量\\c[0]越高，\r\n普通攻击、射击和攻击性能就越强。\r\nWT上限也会逐渐提高。"
}
